  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 4945(d)(4), a grant by a private foundation to a non-501(c)(3) organization is a taxable expenditure unless the foundation exercises expenditure responsibility. The initial tax is 20% on the foundation ($20,000) and 5% on any foundation manager who knowingly approved it ($5,000) under Section 4945(a).
